(4900592, 712003, 29011, '<td valign="top">Excellent! Any tips on setup and drop letting go thinga ma jigs would be appreciated. It ircked me to no end trying to get a drop collision , but if I got as close as this and had to drop ;) that idea and just try something like this I would''ve been a very happy camper. The crown is here is in its truest drop form.</td>', 'Excellent! Any tips on setup and drop letting go thinga ma jigs would be appreciated. It ircked me to no end trying to get a drop collision , but if I got as close as this and had to drop ;) that idea and just try something like this I would''ve been a very happy camper. The crown is here is in its truest drop form.', '2008-08-20 15:12:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900594, 711266, 29011, '<td valign="top">True, grapes are purple but for this challenge I think people wanted to see true color. I think only purple grapes have this specific texture to them so I hope people wont say well maybe these where green ;) (no vote)</td>', 'True, grapes are purple but for this challenge I think people wanted to see true color. I think only purple grapes have this specific texture to them so I hope people wont say well maybe these where green ;) (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:13:52.000000', NULL, 1),
