(4900603, 711278, 29011, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and control of DOF. Though I would''ve liked to see a slightly stronger purple here. (no vote)</td>', 'Beautiful composition and control of DOF. Though I would''ve liked to see a slightly stronger purple here. (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:19:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900610, 710907, 29011, '<td valign="top">Very nicely composed and nice idea. For this challenge perhaps a purple background would''ve been preferred and with the yellow highlights wish the skin tones where tweaked for a warmer more healthful look. Not that the model doesn''t look great though. Just the lighting casts a color on the skin. (no vote)</td>', 'Very nicely composed and nice idea. For this challenge perhaps a purple background would''ve been preferred and with the yellow highlights wish the skin tones where tweaked for a warmer more healthful look. Not that the model doesn''t look great though. Just the lighting casts a color on the skin. (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900612, 712298, 29011, '<td valign="top">Amazing form. Excellent timing. Only have nitpicks with the location chosen for the background and the stone cliff being so prominent. (no vote)</td>', 'Amazing form. Excellent timing. Only have nitpicks with the location chosen for the background and the stone cliff being so prominent. (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:24:16.000000', NULL, 1),
