(4900617, 711294, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. Overall the shot could use some contrast. Perhaps some ice would''ve been better than the mint? turned purple. (no vote)</td>', 'Nice perspective. Overall the shot could use some contrast. Perhaps some ice would''ve been better than the mint? turned purple. (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4900622, 710459, 29011, '<td valign="top">This is way too cool. Love the crown. Is that you Lydia? you''ve outdone yourself. Cant wait to see what you come up with next. My only nitpick, the papers/napkins? at the bottom not being perfectly aligned. I said it was a nitpick ;) The whole setup works well though. (no vote)</td>', 'This is way too cool. Love the crown. Is that you Lydia? you''ve outdone yourself. Cant wait to see what you come up with next. My only nitpick, the papers/napkins? at the bottom not being perfectly aligned. I said it was a nitpick ;) The whole setup works well though. (no vote)', '2008-08-20 15:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
