(4901180, 711250, 45475, '<td valign="top">Wow, this is such a gorgeous and creative shot. The curves, the light, shadows... beautiful. A couple of issues I see that may hurt your score are noise and spots of dirt from your sensor. The noise can be eliminated with the use of noise reduction software and the sensor dirt can be spot edited in basic. This information comes too late now I guess, but I sincerely think that this would make a superb print for you when cleaned up.</td>', 'Wow, this is such a gorgeous and creative shot. The curves, the light, shadows... beautiful. A couple of issues I see that may hurt your score are noise and spots of dirt from your sensor. The noise can be eliminated with the use of noise reduction software and the sensor dirt can be spot edited in basic. This information comes too late now I guess, but I sincerely think that this would make a superb print for you when cleaned up.', '2008-08-20 20:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4901185, 711825, 97166, '<td valign="top">It''s unfortunate that abstracts are anathema to most DPCers.</td>', 'It''s unfortunate that abstracts are anathema to most DPCers.', '2008-08-20 21:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
