(4901190, 710917, 97166, '<td valign="top">Try and avoid using titles of this like. People will be put off by it and will most likely penalize you for it because they may think you are trying for the ''sympathy'' vote.</td>', 'Try and avoid using titles of this like. People will be put off by it and will most likely penalize you for it because they may think you are trying for the ''sympathy'' vote.', '2008-08-20 21:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
