(4901192, 712023, 97166, '<td valign="top">If this was my shot, I''d have tried to do some work in selective color or some similar adjustment (something that adjusts globally) to get that purple to stand out a little more.  It''s <b>there</b> but it''s certainly not there enough for the voter, IMO.</td>', 'If this was my shot, I''d have tried to do some work in selective color or some similar adjustment (something that adjusts globally) to get that purple to stand out a little more.  It''s there but it''s certainly not there enough for the voter, IMO.', '2008-08-20 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
