(4902818, 712234, 74911, '<td valign="top">Because it is a reproduction of an previously done shot, I am not able to resist myself from comparing both the shots, which I should not be doing, I suppose. <br/> <br/>Nicely executed though it was done before. Good lighting. Excellent craft work in preparing the setup.<br/> <br/>What I am missing is the connection between the eggplant and the grape jelly label (other than the fact that they are both purple). Bcos, Techo''s shot was abt a tomato ketchup label on fresh sliced tomatoes, which was screaming the quality &amp; richness of the ketchup brand. May be it is just me. <br/> <br/>Other than that it is just excellent.<br/> <br/>Raj</td>', 'Because it is a reproduction of an previously done shot, I am not able to resist myself from comparing both the shots, which I should not be doing, I suppose.  Nicely executed though it was done before. Good lighting. Excellent craft work in preparing the setup. What I am missing is the connection between the eggplant and the grape jelly label (other than the fact that they are both purple). Bcos, Techo''s shot was abt a tomato ketchup label on fresh sliced tomatoes, which was screaming the quality & richness of the ketchup brand. May be it is just me.  Other than that it is just excellent. Raj', '2008-08-21 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
