(4903523, 711390, 97166, '<td valign="top">you suffered some big-time horizontal banding here. Ouch.</td>', 'you suffered some big-time horizontal banding here. Ouch.', '2008-08-21 22:05:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4903539, 711484, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4.<br/> <br/>I gave this photo a 2 for a few different reasons:<br/> <br/>1. There is no purple in this photo whatsoever.  Even with a generous adjustment for monitor differences, all I see is blue.  In a challenge named "Purple" well, I think it speaks for itself.<br/> <br/>2. The photo itself isn''t pleasing to me in any way.  You have reflections from the glass, there is no point of interest beyond the static subject, focus is off, and just about every other technical aspect to the photo (in DPC terms) simply isn''t there.<br/> <br/>I won''t presume to know or guess on why you entered this photo into this challenge, but because of what I mentioned, it is a 2 from me.</td>', 'Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4. I gave this photo a 2 for a few different reasons: 1. There is no purple in this photo whatsoever.  Even with a generous adjustment for monitor differences, all I see is blue.  In a challenge named "Purple" well, I think it speaks for itself. 2. The photo itself isn''t pleasing to me in any way.  You have reflections from the glass, there is no point of interest beyond the static subject, focus is off, and just about every other technical aspect to the photo (in DPC terms) simply isn''t there. I won''t presume to know or guess on why you entered this photo into this challenge, but because of what I mentioned, it is a 2 from me.', '2008-08-21 22:18:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4903542, 712243, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4.<br/> <br/>I socred this photo a 2 for the follwoing reasons:<br/> <br/>1. Your connection to the challenge is tentative, the main color of this shot is green, with black and then a magenta/pink with a slim leaning into lavender in the flowers.  With the challenge called "Purple", you would need the photo to have much more of a connection to that main color for me.<br/> <br/>2. You''ve missed focus on your main subject, leaving it out of focus in a very glaring way, especially since it comes across as the main focal point to the viewer.<br/> <br/>Technically, and challenge wise, this isn''t a very strong entry for my eyes.</td>', 'Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4. I socred this photo a 2 for the follwoing reasons: 1. Your connection to the challenge is tentative, the main color of this shot is green, with black and then a magenta/pink with a slim leaning into lavender in the flowers.  With the challenge called "Purple", you would need the photo to have much more of a connection to that main color for me. 2. You''ve missed focus on your main subject, leaving it out of focus in a very glaring way, especially since it comes across as the main focal point to the viewer. Technically, and challenge wise, this isn''t a very strong entry for my eyes.', '2008-08-21 22:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4903545, 712164, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4.<br/> <br/>I scored this photo a 2 for the following reason:<br/> <br/>1. Always, always used the maximum pixel dimensions when submitting your photo. If I have to lean into the monitor to see your photo, it annoys me. If I am annoyed, I will score accordingly.</td>', 'Hello,  I have made it a point for this challenge to comment on every photo that I scored under a 4. I scored this photo a 2 for the following reason: 1. Always, always used the maximum pixel dimensions when submitting your photo. If I have to lean into the monitor to see your photo, it annoys me. If I am annoyed, I will score accordingly.', '2008-08-21 22:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4903562, 712298, 96389, '<td valign="top">Wow! My favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'Wow! My favorite of the challenge.', '2008-08-21 22:32:31.000000', NULL, 1),
