(4903723, 710917, 83845, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  Would have been nice to get the subject to ''freeze'' his position for a sec. just to make him stand out from the rest a little more.</td>', 'Great composition.  Would have been nice to get the subject to ''freeze'' his position for a sec. just to make him stand out from the rest a little more.', '2008-08-22 00:24:48.000000', NULL, 1),
