(4903734, 712186, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture and portrayal of Sydney Opera House.  Colour is imazing in this<br/>Not convinced by the crop though.  Probably a little too much taken off the right hand side (ie the Opera house is too much to the right) and also maybe a little too much at the top.  Not sure, the crop just doesn''t seem to work for me.  Good marks though still as its a great shot.</td>', 'Great capture and portrayal of Sydney Opera House.  Colour is imazing in thisNot convinced by the crop though.  Probably a little too much taken off the right hand side (ie the Opera house is too much to the right) and also maybe a little too much at the top.  Not sure, the crop just doesn''t seem to work for me.  Good marks though still as its a great shot.', '2008-08-22 00:28:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4903736, 712170, 83845, '<td valign="top">A very mesmerizing photo.  I love it!</td>', 'A very mesmerizing photo.  I love it!', '2008-08-22 00:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
