(4903990, 711881, 96881, '<td valign="top">Sorry, to me this is a snopshot of a Child. The purple hairband is barely obvious.  The blues and reds jump out, not the purple so doesn''t meet the challenge to me.  The lighting also does not work, as it emphasises the blue pole, and does not emphasis the girl as the subject.</td>', 'Sorry, to me this is a snopshot of a Child. The purple hairband is barely obvious.  The blues and reds jump out, not the purple so doesn''t meet the challenge to me.  The lighting also does not work, as it emphasises the blue pole, and does not emphasis the girl as the subject.', '2008-08-22 02:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
