(4904055, 712028, 28742, '<td valign="top">Composition: 2 - If I didn''t count the massive white on the left it woulda been a 7 for composition<br/>Technical: 5 - Again, the oops on the border cost you on the technical points as well<br/>Creativity: 6<br/>Appeal: 5 - Did I mention that big white space on the left?<br/>Challenge: 7<br/>Overall Calculated Average Score: 5<br/> <br/>I assume the border was a mistake and it sucks getting hammered on that, but that''s the reality - maybe not as bad as "oops, I left the lens cap on, but there really was an incredible shot behind it" but we vote on the final presentation. Now, if you meant to make the border like that, I apologize for thinking it was a mistake, but it still very much affects my opinion of the overall image.</td>', 'Composition: 2 - If I didn''t count the massive white on the left it woulda been a 7 for compositionTechnical: 5 - Again, the oops on the border cost you on the technical points as wellCreativity: 6Appeal: 5 - Did I mention that big white space on the left?Challenge: 7Overall Calculated Average Score: 5 I assume the border was a mistake and it sucks getting hammered on that, but that''s the reality - maybe not as bad as "oops, I left the lens cap on, but there really was an incredible shot behind it" but we vote on the final presentation. Now, if you meant to make the border like that, I apologize for thinking it was a mistake, but it still very much affects my opinion of the overall image.', '2008-08-22 06:01:13.000000', NULL, 1),
