(4904249, 711961, 70298, '<td valign="top">ermmm... I''m lost on the focus of this photo, and it may help if it were a bit more purple, as at first glance it looked grey. Good gradiation and lighting on a positive note, but I''m afraid this really doesn''t do anything for me.</td>', 'ermmm... I''m lost on the focus of this photo, and it may help if it were a bit more purple, as at first glance it looked grey. Good gradiation and lighting on a positive note, but I''m afraid this really doesn''t do anything for me.', '2008-08-22 10:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904256, 712315, 70298, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, nice deep purple of the sky and nice reflections in the water. Like the way the bottom right corner is darkened by the bush, gives it a bit of a viggnetted look.</td>', 'Pretty shot, nice deep purple of the sky and nice reflections in the water. Like the way the bottom right corner is darkened by the bush, gives it a bit of a viggnetted look.', '2008-08-22 10:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4904263, 710917, 70298, '<td valign="top">It''s a good setting for the photo, and the fact that it''s night time adds something extra to it too, which I like. I think people will pick up on the fact that the purple isnt a prominant enough part of the image, as if you look at the other entries the purple colour is dominant, even if it is small. The bright lights distract from it a bit though, meaning It''s slightly blured. For a first entry it''s still a good shot, and you''ll become accustomed to the type and style of shot people enter so it''ll become easier for you.  :  )</td>', 'It''s a good setting for the photo, and the fact that it''s night time adds something extra to it too, which I like. I think people will pick up on the fact that the purple isnt a prominant enough part of the image, as if you look at the other entries the purple colour is dominant, even if it is small. The bright lights distract from it a bit though, meaning It''s slightly blured. For a first entry it''s still a good shot, and you''ll become accustomed to the type and style of shot people enter so it''ll become easier for you.  :  )', '2008-08-22 10:49:54.000000', NULL, 1),
