(4907298, 711999, 97166, '<td valign="top">I bet you thought, "why the heck did I enter a bee on a flower!?" now eh?</td>', 'I bet you thought, "why the heck did I enter a bee on a flower!?" now eh?', '2008-08-24 05:04:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907299, 711266, 97166, '<td valign="top">oh.. my.. <br/> <br/>I''ve seen masochists before, but you are taking it to extremes here!<br/> <br/>The only trouble I have is do I score you low for not meeting the challenge, or do I score you high for taking a chance?<br/> <br/>I''ll give you a 5 for now and ponder this.<br/> <br/>I pondered it. I just can''t in all fairness give this more than a 5.  Those grapes could be green, or red for all I know.  If I give you a higher score, I have to give everyone else that doesn''t have purple in their photo a higher score.<br/> <br/>Forgive me.</td>', 'oh.. my..  I''ve seen masochists before, but you are taking it to extremes here! The only trouble I have is do I score you low for not meeting the challenge, or do I score you high for taking a chance? I''ll give you a 5 for now and ponder this. I pondered it. I just can''t in all fairness give this more than a 5.  Those grapes could be green, or red for all I know.  If I give you a higher score, I have to give everyone else that doesn''t have purple in their photo a higher score. Forgive me.', '2008-08-24 05:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907300, 711961, 97166, '<td valign="top">Very, very interested in seeing where this places.</td>', 'Very, very interested in seeing where this places.', '2008-08-24 05:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907301, 712083, 97166, '<td valign="top">Hehehe. Thanks for the chuckle.</td>', 'Hehehe. Thanks for the chuckle.', '2008-08-24 05:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907302, 711667, 97166, '<td valign="top">I admit it, I''m a sucker for lightning shots.  This one isn''t even all that great, but I scored it higher than many just because it''s lightning.<br/> <br/>*shakes fist*</td>', 'I admit it, I''m a sucker for lightning shots.  This one isn''t even all that great, but I scored it higher than many just because it''s lightning. *shakes fist*', '2008-08-24 05:07:54.000000', NULL, 1),
