(4907366, 711554, 47791, '<td valign="top">Not bad but the flowing cloth looks a bit blurred. Maybe this was intended but Id like to see a sharper capture of the material.</td>', 'Not bad but the flowing cloth looks a bit blurred. Maybe this was intended but Id like to see a sharper capture of the material.', '2008-08-24 09:07:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907370, 710907, 47791, '<td valign="top">A head shot only would have looked better. The shoulders and chest take up too much space in the image. <br/>The gum and eyes really grab the attention.</td>', 'A head shot only would have looked better. The shoulders and chest take up too much space in the image. The gum and eyes really grab the attention.', '2008-08-24 09:08:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907371, 711482, 47791, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DOF.</td>', 'Good composition and DOF.', '2008-08-24 09:09:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907375, 711278, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely and soft though being very centered makes it feel a bit static.  Putting it on the diagonal and more toward one of the bottom corners I think would make it much more dynamic.</td>', 'Lovely and soft though being very centered makes it feel a bit static.  Putting it on the diagonal and more toward one of the bottom corners I think would make it much more dynamic.', '2008-08-24 09:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907376, 710673, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely colours and the stamen pops nicely.  Putting the stamen on more of a diagonal I think would make the image more dynamic.</td>', 'Lovely colours and the stamen pops nicely.  Putting the stamen on more of a diagonal I think would make the image more dynamic.', '2008-08-24 09:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907377, 710747, 7743, '<td valign="top">More than just a water drop/ripple picture.  The texture of the flower adds interest.  Well done.</td>', 'More than just a water drop/ripple picture.  The texture of the flower adds interest.  Well done.', '2008-08-24 09:22:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907378, 710918, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely high key effect.  Good job on the eyes.</td>', 'Lovely high key effect.  Good job on the eyes.', '2008-08-24 09:22:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4907379, 711250, 7743, '<td valign="top">Nice symmetry.  Though I wonder if the image would be more dynamic with the line of small spheres on the diagonal rather than the juxtaposition of the large spheres.</td>', 'Nice symmetry.  Though I wonder if the image would be more dynamic with the line of small spheres on the diagonal rather than the juxtaposition of the large spheres.', '2008-08-24 09:24:10.000000', NULL, 1),
