(4908200, 710917, 7743, '<td valign="top">This an interesting perspective however the person wearing purple is very close to dead center making the image quite static.  Also, being this far away from the camera makes the detail rather hard to see.  Putting him more on the bottom left third line I think would work better.<br/> <br/>Also, the white balance seems to be a bit off, as in too yellow/orange.</td>', 'This an interesting perspective however the person wearing purple is very close to dead center making the image quite static.  Also, being this far away from the camera makes the detail rather hard to see.  Putting him more on the bottom left third line I think would work better. Also, the white balance seems to be a bit off, as in too yellow/orange.', '2008-08-24 20:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908286, 712157, 65234, '<td valign="top">The sunburst is nice; subtle but still a nice addition to the shot.  Like the diagonal leading line and the purple hues.</td>', 'The sunburst is nice; subtle but still a nice addition to the shot.  Like the diagonal leading line and the purple hues.', '2008-08-24 21:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908287, 711250, 65234, '<td valign="top">Cool!  I love the lights in the midst of the shadows.  Very, very nice lighting effect.</td>', 'Cool!  I love the lights in the midst of the shadows.  Very, very nice lighting effect.', '2008-08-24 21:16:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908289, 711540, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice light and very soft sweet portait.  I see a costume but not an actual tutu, but never mind that ;-)</td>', 'Nice light and very soft sweet portait.  I see a costume but not an actual tutu, but never mind that ;-)', '2008-08-24 21:17:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908290, 711110, 65234, '<td valign="top">Great sharpness on the dragonfly, especially those wings!  Soft purples make a nice background.</td>', 'Great sharpness on the dragonfly, especially those wings!  Soft purples make a nice background.', '2008-08-24 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908292, 711835, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nicely fills the frame.  Lost a little detail in the yellow-greens but otherwise a very nice shot.</td>', 'Nicely fills the frame.  Lost a little detail in the yellow-greens but otherwise a very nice shot.', '2008-08-24 21:19:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908293, 711815, 65234, '<td valign="top">Fun patterns and LOTS of purple!</td>', 'Fun patterns and LOTS of purple!', '2008-08-24 21:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908296, 711948, 65234, '<td valign="top">My kind of scene; a butterfly and purple flowers (thistles?).  Lost a little detail here and there but overall a very nice shot.</td>', 'My kind of scene; a butterfly and purple flowers (thistles?).  Lost a little detail here and there but overall a very nice shot.', '2008-08-24 21:21:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908297, 712219, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely flowers!  Nice background green, too.  I would have cropped out that bright leaf on the bottom and maybe rotated a bit to get rid of the stem on the right, as they draw my eye and aren''t nearly as interesting as the flowers.</td>', 'Lovely flowers!  Nice background green, too.  I would have cropped out that bright leaf on the bottom and maybe rotated a bit to get rid of the stem on the right, as they draw my eye and aren''t nearly as interesting as the flowers.', '2008-08-24 21:22:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908299, 712234, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very creative concept!  The flower seems kind of random but does balance the composition a bit.</td>', 'Very creative concept!  The flower seems kind of random but does balance the composition a bit.', '2008-08-24 21:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908300, 711375, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lots of different textures to study here.  I think I would have liked the feather up farther in the compostion and maybe angled more; the sharp line of its edge is jarring in comparison to the fabric and softness of the feather''s edges and would work better for me across the corner.</td>', 'Lots of different textures to study here.  I think I would have liked the feather up farther in the compostion and maybe angled more; the sharp line of its edge is jarring in comparison to the fabric and softness of the feather''s edges and would work better for me across the corner.', '2008-08-24 21:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908301, 712114, 65234, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like a mummy''s head; yikes!!</td>', 'Almost looks like a mummy''s head; yikes!!', '2008-08-24 21:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908303, 712059, 65234, '<td valign="top">I do like the curl of the petals; I think a touch more DOF would be better and maybe a bit of angle to the composition to make it more dynamic.</td>', 'I do like the curl of the petals; I think a touch more DOF would be better and maybe a bit of angle to the composition to make it more dynamic.', '2008-08-24 21:28:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908308, 710839, 65234, '<td valign="top">Very nicely done.  Not as purple as some in this challenge and the subject doesn''t scream "purple" to me, but the technicals are impressive.</td>', 'Very nicely done.  Not as purple as some in this challenge and the subject doesn''t scream "purple" to me, but the technicals are impressive.', '2008-08-24 21:31:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908310, 711999, 65234, '<td valign="top">Some nice detail here and the flower looks really interesting.  Whites are a bit blown in places which is something of a nit, as I realize from the darkness of the stem that this was a tricky exposure.</td>', 'Some nice detail here and the flower looks really interesting.  Whites are a bit blown in places which is something of a nit, as I realize from the darkness of the stem that this was a tricky exposure.', '2008-08-24 21:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908312, 712324, 65234, '<td valign="top">Pretty little flower.  In this case I think I''d like to see the whole foreground in focus or the shot taken from more of an angle so the OOF foreground petal didn''t dominate the shot so much.</td>', 'Pretty little flower.  In this case I think I''d like to see the whole foreground in focus or the shot taken from more of an angle so the OOF foreground petal didn''t dominate the shot so much.', '2008-08-24 21:36:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908313, 712277, 65234, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract.  Somehow I want that center edge to be in focus, though, and the focus looks to be right behind it.</td>', 'Nice abstract.  Somehow I want that center edge to be in focus, though, and the focus looks to be right behind it.', '2008-08-24 21:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908314, 712314, 65234, '<td valign="top">Lovely little water drop reflection!  For this challenge I think I would have cropped out more of the leafy bit on the bottom and kept more of the flower on top, if that were possible.</td>', 'Lovely little water drop reflection!  For this challenge I think I would have cropped out more of the leafy bit on the bottom and kept more of the flower on top, if that were possible.', '2008-08-24 21:38:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908315, 712322, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely and soft.  The focus is perfectly placed.  However, I feel this image would be much better if shown vertically to exploit the long base of the flower.</td>', 'Lovely and soft.  The focus is perfectly placed.  However, I feel this image would be much better if shown vertically to exploit the long base of the flower.', '2008-08-24 21:39:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908316, 711442, 7743, '<td valign="top">Lovely bokeh.  I like how it mimics the texture of the flower.</td>', 'Lovely bokeh.  I like how it mimics the texture of the flower.', '2008-08-24 21:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908425, 712237, 30669, '<td valign="top">Spectacular. I can never get a dragonfly to stay still long enough. Beautiful shot   10</td>', 'Spectacular. I can never get a dragonfly to stay still long enough. Beautiful shot   10', '2008-08-24 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4908475, 711671, 60047, '<td valign="top">I really like the macro effect of this shot. I think the large amount of blur in the knife detracts from the power of the rest of the shot. I am impressed with the DOF on this shot. Great subject for the challenge.</td>', 'I really like the macro effect of this shot. I think the large amount of blur in the knife detracts from the power of the rest of the shot. I am impressed with the DOF on this shot. Great subject for the challenge.', '2008-08-25 00:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
