(4911070, 711293, 96957, '<td valign="top">It''s a good idea in principle, and that makes it a 6 to me. But when I think still life I think e.g. Cezanne -- a composition so beautiful that I just don''t want to stop looking at it. To me that''s the extra something lacking in this photo.</td>', 'It''s a good idea in principle, and that makes it a 6 to me. But when I think still life I think e.g. Cezanne -- a composition so beautiful that I just don''t want to stop looking at it. To me that''s the extra something lacking in this photo.', '2008-08-25 22:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911072, 712213, 96957, '<td valign="top">Pretty humorous. And a good way to reuse the woody ;)</td>', 'Pretty humorous. And a good way to reuse the woody ;)', '2008-08-25 22:48:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911112, 712079, 3102, '<td valign="top">If that''s supposed to look like blood, I''m afraid it looks more like she just polished off a sloppy bowl of spaghetti :)</td>', 'If that''s supposed to look like blood, I''m afraid it looks more like she just polished off a sloppy bowl of spaghetti :)', '2008-08-25 22:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911132, 712308, 96957, '<td valign="top">She is really adorable. But unfortunately the picture feels a bit like it was shot with a point and shoot camera -- it''s nicely framed, but it''s not quite sharp enough. 7 because of the subject.</td>', 'She is really adorable. But unfortunately the picture feels a bit like it was shot with a point and shoot camera -- it''s nicely framed, but it''s not quite sharp enough. 7 because of the subject.', '2008-08-25 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911161, 712076, 96957, '<td valign="top">One of a few 10''s for me in this challenge. This picture is like a Georgia O''Keefe painting. The way the yellow spills out of the contrasting purple is incredible. I would give you 11 if I could.</td>', 'One of a few 10''s for me in this challenge. This picture is like a Georgia O''Keefe painting. The way the yellow spills out of the contrasting purple is incredible. I would give you 11 if I could.', '2008-08-25 23:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911604, 711250, 97810, '<td valign="top">This is interesting, and I like the focus of light in the shadows, but I find it difficult to know where to look - it''s a bit busy.</td>', 'This is interesting, and I like the focus of light in the shadows, but I find it difficult to know where to look - it''s a bit busy.', '2008-08-26 04:51:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911605, 712211, 97810, '<td valign="top">not enough purple</td>', 'not enough purple', '2008-08-26 04:51:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911754, 712086, 91314, '<td valign="top">Portrait not as crisp and there seems to be more of a reddish tint in the photo, like she has been in the sun too long.  Maybe if you had dynamically focus on the hand, scarf and face and use more lighting.</td>', 'Portrait not as crisp and there seems to be more of a reddish tint in the photo, like she has been in the sun too long.  Maybe if you had dynamically focus on the hand, scarf and face and use more lighting.', '2008-08-26 09:55:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911755, 712164, 91314, '<td valign="top">I see that the flowers are purple but if the pic was bigger to help define the bee and collecting from the flower would have made this pic better.</td>', 'I see that the flowers are purple but if the pic was bigger to help define the bee and collecting from the flower would have made this pic better.', '2008-08-26 09:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911811, 712307, 58728, '<td valign="top">Absolutely stunning.  The border really works well here.  I love the suble white line to set the border off from the photo.  Composed perfectly.  10.</td>', 'Absolutely stunning.  The border really works well here.  I love the suble white line to set the border off from the photo.  Composed perfectly.  10.', '2008-08-26 10:35:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4911824, 712247, 58728, '<td valign="top">Lovely!  I like the slightly off centered comp.  Great execution!</td>', 'Lovely!  I like the slightly off centered comp.  Great execution!', '2008-08-26 10:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
