(4912113, 712298, 93927, '<td valign="top">wow... this has the potential to be a very cool image. the (what is assume to be a) rock on the bottom left this very distracting, as are the people in the background.</td>', 'wow... this has the potential to be a very cool image. the (what is assume to be a) rock on the bottom left this very distracting, as are the people in the background.', '2008-08-26 13:54:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912158, 712034, 86447, '<td valign="top">Just not a sharp focus for the subject, I fear.  I like the DOF, though.</td>', 'Just not a sharp focus for the subject, I fear.  I like the DOF, though.', '2008-08-26 14:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912159, 711360, 86447, '<td valign="top">I don''t see any purple... sorry.  *sigh*   I hope someone else does for you, though.</td>', 'I don''t see any purple... sorry.  *sigh*   I hope someone else does for you, though.', '2008-08-26 14:12:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912161, 711900, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the purple flower... I wish there was a bit more sharpness on the bee''s entire body (looks like that one leg is sharp) and a tad bit more light so we could see his details better.</td>', 'I like the purple flower... I wish there was a bit more sharpness on the bee''s entire body (looks like that one leg is sharp) and a tad bit more light so we could see his details better.', '2008-08-26 14:13:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912163, 712067, 86447, '<td valign="top">"Flat" flowers rarely photograph as well as ones with petals... This is purple, but I think they background''s being so busy is distracting.</td>', '"Flat" flowers rarely photograph as well as ones with petals... This is purple, but I think they background''s being so busy is distracting.', '2008-08-26 14:14:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912165, 710595, 86447, '<td valign="top">The only thing purple about this is a piece of trash next to a broken stem, right?   Or am I missing something?   <br/> <br/>Surely there was something else purple to shoot...   I hate to be brutal with my honesty... but there it is and I can''t figure out how to say it any differently.</td>', 'The only thing purple about this is a piece of trash next to a broken stem, right?   Or am I missing something?    Surely there was something else purple to shoot...   I hate to be brutal with my honesty... but there it is and I can''t figure out how to say it any differently.', '2008-08-26 14:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912167, 711436, 86447, '<td valign="top">I like the composition on this... but the detail in the flowers is not shown very well, in my opinion.</td>', 'I like the composition on this... but the detail in the flowers is not shown very well, in my opinion.', '2008-08-26 14:16:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912168, 712243, 86447, '<td valign="top">I wish we could see more detail of the bee... and that it had more focus on it instead of the plant.</td>', 'I wish we could see more detail of the bee... and that it had more focus on it instead of the plant.', '2008-08-26 14:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912169, 711040, 86447, '<td valign="top">A bit more light from the front would have helped this, I think.<br/> <br/>I like the idea.</td>', 'A bit more light from the front would have helped this, I think. I like the idea.', '2008-08-26 14:17:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912171, 711961, 86447, '<td valign="top">Definitely minimalist.  But, it''s too much so, in my opinion, because it''s not holding my interest.</td>', 'Definitely minimalist.  But, it''s too much so, in my opinion, because it''s not holding my interest.', '2008-08-26 14:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912172, 712155, 86447, '<td valign="top">The centered composition of this is not as pleasing as off center would have been, I think.</td>', 'The centered composition of this is not as pleasing as off center would have been, I think.', '2008-08-26 14:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912175, 712343, 86447, '<td valign="top">More brightness/contrast or curves might have helped this.   It''s nice and sharp and well composed, I think.</td>', 'More brightness/contrast or curves might have helped this.   It''s nice and sharp and well composed, I think.', '2008-08-26 14:19:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912177, 710673, 86447, '<td valign="top">This might be too tight of a crop.  There is much noise in the center.</td>', 'This might be too tight of a crop.  There is much noise in the center.', '2008-08-26 14:19:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912181, 712164, 86447, '<td valign="top">This needs to be larger so we can see it to vote on it, in my opinion.<br/> <br/>Too small images rarely score well.  The longest side should be as close to 640 pixels as possible.</td>', 'This needs to be larger so we can see it to vote on it, in my opinion. Too small images rarely score well.  The longest side should be as close to 640 pixels as possible.', '2008-08-26 14:20:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912182, 711747, 86447, '<td valign="top">A bit more sharpness would have helped this, I think.</td>', 'A bit more sharpness would have helped this, I think.', '2008-08-26 14:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912183, 710907, 86447, '<td valign="top">I think a purple background would have met the challenge better AND worked better with the eyeshadow and bubble color.   Nice focus and composition.</td>', 'I think a purple background would have met the challenge better AND worked better with the eyeshadow and bubble color.   Nice focus and composition.', '2008-08-26 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912195, 711110, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the way his wings are catching the sunlight. It shows off the detail nicely.</td>', 'I like the way his wings are catching the sunlight. It shows off the detail nicely.', '2008-08-26 14:33:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912200, 711484, 83313, '<td valign="top">Shooting into a aquarium is tough, I''ve only had very limited success at it. I''m afraid this came across looking like a snapshot.</td>', 'Shooting into a aquarium is tough, I''ve only had very limited success at it. I''m afraid this came across looking like a snapshot.', '2008-08-26 14:35:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912202, 712034, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice enough, but just doesn''t seem to have any impact for me.</td>', 'Nice enough, but just doesn''t seem to have any impact for me.', '2008-08-26 14:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912206, 712273, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not a realistic color for a hard disk, but I like it.</td>', 'Not a realistic color for a hard disk, but I like it.', '2008-08-26 14:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912207, 711950, 83313, '<td valign="top">Duotone works. Very artsy.</td>', 'Duotone works. Very artsy.', '2008-08-26 14:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912212, 711213, 83313, '<td valign="top">Yes, it''s lots of purple, but I think it comes off as an inappropriate treatment for this landscape.</td>', 'Yes, it''s lots of purple, but I think it comes off as an inappropriate treatment for this landscape.', '2008-08-26 14:41:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4912214, 712179, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost looks like one of those colorful posters that girls like to decorate with. A little motion blur hurts it a bit, I think.<br/> <br/>Post-challenge edited to add: Now I remember what it''s called that it reminds me of. Lisa Frank is the artist I was thinking of.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-27 00:21:11.</i></td>', 'Almost looks like one of those colorful posters that girls like to decorate with. A little motion blur hurts it a bit, I think. Post-challenge edited to add: Now I remember what it''s called that it reminds me of. Lisa Frank is the artist I was thinking of.', '2008-08-26 14:43:14.000000', '2008-08-27 01:21:11.000000', 1),
(4912221, 711900, 83313, '<td valign="top">I know it''s tough to get this close a shot, but I don''t find this shot to grab me. Maybe it needs a bit of a bump in the yellows, and a touch sharper.</td>', 'I know it''s tough to get this close a shot, but I don''t find this shot to grab me. Maybe it needs a bit of a bump in the yellows, and a touch sharper.', '2008-08-26 14:46:12.000000', NULL, 1),
