(4913216, 710673, 83313, '<td valign="top">At first glance, I thought this was a shot of a galaxy exploding or some other cosmic event.  A bit of noise grain (intentional grain perhaps?) in the highlight areas, but it does not hurt the image too much. I''m not a huge fan of floral shots. One has to be outstanding to get my attention, and I''m faving this one.</td>', 'At first glance, I thought this was a shot of a galaxy exploding or some other cosmic event.  A bit of noise grain (intentional grain perhaps?) in the highlight areas, but it does not hurt the image too much. I''m not a huge fan of floral shots. One has to be outstanding to get my attention, and I''m faving this one.', '2008-08-26 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913217, 712076, 94265, '<td valign="top">The picture is lovely and soft and as such, the block yellow is a bit bold, I''m not keen on that contrast. The purple petals look fabulous though, I give this a 6.</td>', 'The picture is lovely and soft and as such, the block yellow is a bit bold, I''m not keen on that contrast. The purple petals look fabulous though, I give this a 6.', '2008-08-26 23:25:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913218, 712343, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love the texture and the position of those centre petals.</td>', 'I love the texture and the position of those centre petals.', '2008-08-26 23:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913220, 712315, 94265, '<td valign="top">The lower half of the pic doesn''t particularly grab me (water is a bit drab and the bridge is very dark) but the sky is a wonderful colour.</td>', 'The lower half of the pic doesn''t particularly grab me (water is a bit drab and the bridge is very dark) but the sky is a wonderful colour.', '2008-08-26 23:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913222, 710712, 83313, '<td valign="top">The image looks a little soft as if it was a good idea executed as a snapshot. Needs some adjustments to give it a little pop. I do see some potential in this, however.  I''m afraid the title could use a little creativity as well. I do like the composition and subject.</td>', 'The image looks a little soft as if it was a good idea executed as a snapshot. Needs some adjustments to give it a little pop. I do see some potential in this, however.  I''m afraid the title could use a little creativity as well. I do like the composition and subject.', '2008-08-26 23:28:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913223, 711835, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus and beautiful colours. I''d have left the crop a wee bit higher at the top mind.</td>', 'Nice soft focus and beautiful colours. I''d have left the crop a wee bit higher at the top mind.', '2008-08-26 23:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913225, 712092, 94265, '<td valign="top">Original idea.</td>', 'Original idea.', '2008-08-26 23:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913226, 710879, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what''s going on here, but its an interesting pic. A bit of posterization is clearly visible in the shading of the sky.</td>', 'Not sure what''s going on here, but its an interesting pic. A bit of posterization is clearly visible in the shading of the sky.', '2008-08-26 23:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913227, 711842, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light reflection on the green there is a wee bit distracting but otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'The light reflection on the green there is a wee bit distracting but otherwise, very nice.', '2008-08-26 23:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913229, 711823, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very nice scene and sky.</td>', 'Very nice scene and sky.', '2008-08-26 23:30:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913230, 712281, 94265, '<td valign="top">Haha I like this.</td>', 'Haha I like this.', '2008-08-26 23:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913232, 712272, 94265, '<td valign="top">Wow, great colour and a nice smooth look about it.</td>', 'Wow, great colour and a nice smooth look about it.', '2008-08-26 23:30:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913233, 712279, 94265, '<td valign="top">I love this idea, I find the flash a wee bit too bright though.</td>', 'I love this idea, I find the flash a wee bit too bright though.', '2008-08-26 23:30:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913234, 711525, 83313, '<td valign="top">Can''t get more purple than this! I assume this has personal significance for you. The crop on the medal seems a little tight to me.</td>', 'Can''t get more purple than this! I assume this has personal significance for you. The crop on the medal seems a little tight to me.', '2008-08-26 23:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913239, 712322, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d like just a wee bit more light but this is very nice.</td>', 'I''d like just a wee bit more light but this is very nice.', '2008-08-26 23:31:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913240, 712010, 94265, '<td valign="top">The sky and water are a wee bit too close colour-wise but the sweeping scenery looks great.</td>', 'The sky and water are a wee bit too close colour-wise but the sweeping scenery looks great.', '2008-08-26 23:31:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913241, 710912, 83313, '<td valign="top">No Buzz! Don''t go into the light! It''s a trap!! (Sorry, first impressions going on there...)</td>', 'No Buzz! Don''t go into the light! It''s a trap!! (Sorry, first impressions going on there...)', '2008-08-26 23:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913242, 710876, 94265, '<td valign="top">Pic is a bit scattered, not sure where to look first! Good idea though.</td>', 'Pic is a bit scattered, not sure where to look first! Good idea though.', '2008-08-26 23:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913244, 712054, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is very cute, like it a lot.</td>', 'This is very cute, like it a lot.', '2008-08-26 23:33:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913246, 711351, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like those 4 little flowers along the rope.</td>', 'I like those 4 little flowers along the rope.', '2008-08-26 23:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913248, 711883, 94265, '<td valign="top">Shame the bottom flower is cut off but still nice colours.</td>', 'Shame the bottom flower is cut off but still nice colours.', '2008-08-26 23:34:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913249, 712251, 83313, '<td valign="top">Almost appears to be selective desaturation, but I can see a (very) slight red in the rocks indicating it was done withing basic rules.  Nice job on this. A fave.</td>', 'Almost appears to be selective desaturation, but I can see a (very) slight red in the rocks indicating it was done withing basic rules.  Nice job on this. A fave.', '2008-08-26 23:34:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913253, 711648, 94265, '<td valign="top">Very moody and nice focus, I''d like the light on his face to be a bit softer though like on the rest of his body.</td>', 'Very moody and nice focus, I''d like the light on his face to be a bit softer though like on the rest of his body.', '2008-08-26 23:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913254, 712202, 94265, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous colours, normally I''d not like those 3 bright lights but they actually make an Ok focal point.</td>', 'Gorgeous colours, normally I''d not like those 3 bright lights but they actually make an Ok focal point.', '2008-08-26 23:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913255, 711540, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good sweet portrait, however, the way her face appears in the light looks a bit odd to me. Maybe the light is too dead-on in front of her.</td>', 'Good sweet portrait, however, the way her face appears in the light looks a bit odd to me. Maybe the light is too dead-on in front of her.', '2008-08-26 23:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913257, 712107, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like some harsh flash on this, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Looks like some harsh flash on this, I''m afraid.', '2008-08-26 23:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913258, 711671, 94265, '<td valign="top">The chopper would''ve looked cool if it were buffed and gleaming, though that might''ve caused glare issues. Nice idea.</td>', 'The chopper would''ve looked cool if it were buffed and gleaming, though that might''ve caused glare issues. Nice idea.', '2008-08-26 23:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913261, 711303, 94265, '<td valign="top">I wish the 2 foreground bits were in focus, it''s a nice composition of different materials though.</td>', 'I wish the 2 foreground bits were in focus, it''s a nice composition of different materials though.', '2008-08-26 23:37:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913262, 711250, 81362, '<td valign="top">What a great use of related geometric shapes, balls, curves, dark circles with bright centers, implied diagonal line between the two large balls, coming together in a simple and beautiful design. My prediction for blue ribbon.</td>', 'What a great use of related geometric shapes, balls, curves, dark circles with bright centers, implied diagonal line between the two large balls, coming together in a simple and beautiful design. My prediction for blue ribbon.', '2008-08-26 23:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913266, 712284, 81362, '<td valign="top">The side-back lighting really enhances the image and accentuates the interesting shapes. Nicely done.</td>', 'The side-back lighting really enhances the image and accentuates the interesting shapes. Nicely done.', '2008-08-26 23:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913267, 711266, 83313, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm. Nice OOB thinking on this. But, how do I know they are not green grapes? Gotta give you a good score for both a well done image and making me have to think about it. Hope you don''t get killed with DNMC votes, because this deserves to do well.</td>', 'Hmmmm. Nice OOB thinking on this. But, how do I know they are not green grapes? Gotta give you a good score for both a well done image and making me have to think about it. Hope you don''t get killed with DNMC votes, because this deserves to do well.', '2008-08-26 23:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913270, 712110, 83313, '<td valign="top">Sure, put some pretty bikini clad girls in the pic and then hide them behind some, uh, <i>purple</i> umbrellas.</td>', 'Sure, put some pretty bikini clad girls in the pic and then hide them behind some, uh, purple umbrellas.', '2008-08-26 23:40:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913271, 711266, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure this meets criteria since it''s black and white, I''m assuming the grapes are purple? Shame we can''t see the colour, it''d make a great shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure this meets criteria since it''s black and white, I''m assuming the grapes are purple? Shame we can''t see the colour, it''d make a great shot.', '2008-08-26 23:41:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913272, 710874, 94265, '<td valign="top">The reflections are awesome.</td>', 'The reflections are awesome.', '2008-08-26 23:41:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913274, 712024, 94265, '<td valign="top">The light just beneath the boots is a bit too bright, good idea though, the colours are complimentary.</td>', 'The light just beneath the boots is a bit too bright, good idea though, the colours are complimentary.', '2008-08-26 23:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913275, 711796, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure what I''m looking at but I like it.</td>', 'Not sure what I''m looking at but I like it.', '2008-08-26 23:42:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913277, 712274, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, his eyes almost reflect the flowers'' colour I think.</td>', 'Nice macro, his eyes almost reflect the flowers'' colour I think.', '2008-08-26 23:42:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913279, 710673, 94265, '<td valign="top">As you say, glorious.</td>', 'As you say, glorious.', '2008-08-26 23:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913280, 712142, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the glow this picture possesses.</td>', 'Love the glow this picture possesses.', '2008-08-26 23:43:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913281, 712234, 81362, '<td valign="top">Confounding us with purple grape on purple eggplant sets the funny tone, but slicing the eggplant sends this brilliantly into the surreal zone. Very enjoyable.</td>', 'Confounding us with purple grape on purple eggplant sets the funny tone, but slicing the eggplant sends this brilliantly into the surreal zone. Very enjoyable.', '2008-08-26 23:43:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913289, 710618, 81362, '<td valign="top">Looks like someone already slipped into something more comfortable. The repeating diagonal lacing with bright eyelets takes the center of the picture almost into the realm of abstract, which I like.</td>', 'Looks like someone already slipped into something more comfortable. The repeating diagonal lacing with bright eyelets takes the center of the picture almost into the realm of abstract, which I like.', '2008-08-26 23:45:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913290, 710918, 83313, '<td valign="top">I see some softness and compression artifacts that don''t belong. Your file size of only 76k indicates you could have gotten more clarity and detail into this shot. compression kills. Check your settings when you save your file and always save as close as you can to the challenge limit. (150k for basic) I''ll probably be the only one to leave such a comment, however.  Otherwise, this is a very good and artistically done shot.</td>', 'I see some softness and compression artifacts that don''t belong. Your file size of only 76k indicates you could have gotten more clarity and detail into this shot. compression kills. Check your settings when you save your file and always save as close as you can to the challenge limit. (150k for basic) I''ll probably be the only one to leave such a comment, however.  Otherwise, this is a very good and artistically done shot.', '2008-08-26 23:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913294, 712302, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure what it is, but this appears like you put some planning and thought into it. Not sure if it is the overall lighting that is the problem for me, or maybe it''s the crop on the right side.</td>', 'Not sure what it is, but this appears like you put some planning and thought into it. Not sure if it is the overall lighting that is the problem for me, or maybe it''s the crop on the right side.', '2008-08-26 23:46:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913295, 712157, 94265, '<td valign="top">Love the shape of the sun in this, very nice sky.</td>', 'Love the shape of the sun in this, very nice sky.', '2008-08-26 23:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913296, 710763, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows, cool abstract.</td>', 'Nice shadows, cool abstract.', '2008-08-26 23:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913297, 712206, 94265, '<td valign="top">This has a nice old-fashioned feel to it.</td>', 'This has a nice old-fashioned feel to it.', '2008-08-26 23:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913298, 711525, 94265, '<td valign="top">Great idea, light glare on the paper is a wee touch bright but nonetheless a great pic.</td>', 'Great idea, light glare on the paper is a wee touch bright but nonetheless a great pic.', '2008-08-26 23:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913299, 712277, 94265, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is but it''s very interesting and eye-catching.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is but it''s very interesting and eye-catching.', '2008-08-26 23:50:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913301, 711552, 94265, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it needed so much blur in the back there but it''s a good shot.</td>', 'I don''t think it needed so much blur in the back there but it''s a good shot.', '2008-08-26 23:51:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913303, 711748, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like that sweeping bar of colour in the background.</td>', 'I like that sweeping bar of colour in the background.', '2008-08-26 23:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913304, 711950, 94265, '<td valign="top">Some detail loss in the centre of the flower but very pretty and delicate.</td>', 'Some detail loss in the centre of the flower but very pretty and delicate.', '2008-08-26 23:52:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913305, 712253, 81362, '<td valign="top">I would consider pointing the camera a little higher to reduce the extent of out of focus foreground and to allow the composition to have full circles (makeup holder and reflection) for geometric contrast with the the straight lines that intersect with the mirror. The jumble of colored dust has interesting texture. Having so little purple in the image probably will reduce the score in a "purple" challenge.</td>', 'I would consider pointing the camera a little higher to reduce the extent of out of focus foreground and to allow the composition to have full circles (makeup holder and reflection) for geometric contrast with the the straight lines that intersect with the mirror. The jumble of colored dust has interesting texture. Having so little purple in the image probably will reduce the score in a "purple" challenge.', '2008-08-26 23:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913306, 712247, 63633, '<td valign="top">A very clean image - lovely.</td>', 'A very clean image - lovely.', '2008-08-26 23:56:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913308, 711648, 63633, '<td valign="top">Looks like a Cadbury advert :) Love it!</td>', 'Looks like a Cadbury advert :) Love it!', '2008-08-26 23:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913309, 712316, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is really nice, the yellow ducky stands out nicely and the parcel is great.</td>', 'This is really nice, the yellow ducky stands out nicely and the parcel is great.', '2008-08-26 23:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913310, 712114, 63633, '<td valign="top">Composition and colours are beautiful.</td>', 'Composition and colours are beautiful.', '2008-08-26 23:57:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913311, 710763, 63633, '<td valign="top">I love the simplicity of this image.</td>', 'I love the simplicity of this image.', '2008-08-26 23:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913312, 711482, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d like a bit more of it to be in focus but it''s a good shot, the texture of the green is great.</td>', 'I''d like a bit more of it to be in focus but it''s a good shot, the texture of the green is great.', '2008-08-26 23:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913313, 711299, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.</td>', 'Nice idea.', '2008-08-26 23:58:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913314, 712024, 63633, '<td valign="top">I really like your lighting setup.</td>', 'I really like your lighting setup.', '2008-08-26 23:58:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913315, 711999, 94265, '<td valign="top">Good macro and I like the title.</td>', 'Good macro and I like the title.', '2008-08-26 23:58:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913316, 712108, 94265, '<td valign="top">I give this 5, would''ve been 6 I think if she were centered.</td>', 'I give this 5, would''ve been 6 I think if she were centered.', '2008-08-26 23:58:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913317, 712297, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice job.</td>', 'Nice job.', '2008-08-26 23:59:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913318, 712174, 94265, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see this a little closer to the girl and not have so much of the path in view.</td>', 'I''d like to see this a little closer to the girl and not have so much of the path in view.', '2008-08-26 23:59:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913319, 710822, 63633, '<td valign="top">Far less contrived that a lot of the other entries. I believe that this subject actually <i>was</i> purple originally!</td>', 'Far less contrived that a lot of the other entries. I believe that this subject actually was purple originally!', '2008-08-26 23:59:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913321, 710867, 94265, '<td valign="top">I like this, I think it''d have been even better if the net material had been more purple to match the eyeshadow.</td>', 'I like this, I think it''d have been even better if the net material had been more purple to match the eyeshadow.', '2008-08-27 00:00:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913322, 711375, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice mix of materials.</td>', 'Nice mix of materials.', '2008-08-27 00:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913323, 711843, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.</td>', 'Nice composition.', '2008-08-27 00:00:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913324, 711278, 63633, '<td valign="top">I <i>love</i> this image, particularly the symmetry (adding to favs). It just doesn''t say purple to me.</td>', 'I love this image, particularly the symmetry (adding to favs). It just doesn''t say purple to me.', '2008-08-27 00:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913327, 710827, 63633, '<td valign="top">This is <i>so</i> purple. Meets the challenge perfectly!</td>', 'This is so purple. Meets the challenge perfectly!', '2008-08-27 00:01:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913330, 710907, 63633, '<td valign="top">Oh, imagine what this would have been with advanced editing! Great image how it is though :)</td>', 'Oh, imagine what this would have been with advanced editing! Great image how it is though :)', '2008-08-27 00:02:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913331, 712307, 63633, '<td valign="top">Lovely. <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=34938" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Hotpasta</a> maybe?</td>', 'Lovely.  Hotpasta maybe?', '2008-08-27 00:03:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913332, 712115, 94265, '<td valign="top">The white tips have very little detail due to the brightness but I love the detail in the centre of the flower.</td>', 'The white tips have very little detail due to the brightness but I love the detail in the centre of the flower.', '2008-08-27 00:04:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913333, 710836, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice but needs something more to focus on I think.</td>', 'Nice but needs something more to focus on I think.', '2008-08-27 00:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913335, 712016, 63633, '<td valign="top">I really like this. Would be even better with a bit of noise reduction.</td>', 'I really like this. Would be even better with a bit of noise reduction.', '2008-08-27 00:04:54.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(4913336, 712250, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice scenery and pretty purple hills.</td>', 'Nice scenery and pretty purple hills.', '2008-08-27 00:05:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913344, 712333, 94265, '<td valign="top">Focus is a bit soft in the centre there but the orange tips are really nice.</td>', 'Focus is a bit soft in the centre there but the orange tips are really nice.', '2008-08-27 00:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913348, 711933, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hairy flowers....? Strange haha. Interesting but that glare in the top left is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Hairy flowers....? Strange haha. Interesting but that glare in the top left is a bit distracting.', '2008-08-27 00:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913351, 712110, 94265, '<td valign="top">This is a good one, maybe would''ve looked a bit better from behind with the parasols tipped back. The water looks nice.</td>', 'This is a good one, maybe would''ve looked a bit better from behind with the parasols tipped back. The water looks nice.', '2008-08-27 00:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913355, 711815, 94265, '<td valign="top">They look like little olives, nice colour.</td>', 'They look like little olives, nice colour.', '2008-08-27 00:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913358, 712219, 94265, '<td valign="top">Light''s a wee bit flat, I like the side-composition though.</td>', 'Light''s a wee bit flat, I like the side-composition though.', '2008-08-27 00:12:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913361, 712083, 94265, '<td valign="top">Hehe very humerous.</td>', 'Hehe very humerous.', '2008-08-27 00:12:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913363, 711947, 94265, '<td valign="top">This would''ve got more points from me were it a bit sharper, nice photo though.</td>', 'This would''ve got more points from me were it a bit sharper, nice photo though.', '2008-08-27 00:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913367, 710828, 94265, '<td valign="top">Little thing that could''ve made this a bit better for me would''ve been a droplet of ink on the tip of the pen. Really nice job anyway.</td>', 'Little thing that could''ve made this a bit better for me would''ve been a droplet of ink on the tip of the pen. Really nice job anyway.', '2008-08-27 00:13:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913373, 712299, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, I''d have liked the depth of field to have excluded the little flowers on the stem though, it''d be nice to see them in focus too.</td>', 'Nice composition, I''d have liked the depth of field to have excluded the little flowers on the stem though, it''d be nice to see them in focus too.', '2008-08-27 00:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913376, 711521, 94265, '<td valign="top">Nice soft focus.</td>', 'Nice soft focus.', '2008-08-27 00:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913377, 710905, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great Photo.  The colouring adds to the photo here (in contrast to many others, where they have just coloured a photo and the purple adds nothing).  It helps set the mood here.  Love the Full Moon, obviously the right time of the month for you with this challenge.  Exccelent Entry.</td>', 'Great Photo.  The colouring adds to the photo here (in contrast to many others, where they have just coloured a photo and the purple adds nothing).  It helps set the mood here.  Love the Full Moon, obviously the right time of the month for you with this challenge.  Exccelent Entry.', '2008-08-27 00:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913378, 711667, 96881, '<td valign="top">Exceptional capture, great processing and fits the Challenge exceptionally well.  The Best I have seen So far</td>', 'Exceptional capture, great processing and fits the Challenge exceptionally well.  The Best I have seen So far', '2008-08-27 00:15:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913380, 711820, 96881, '<td valign="top">Great capture.  The purple sets the mood so the colouring is well done.</td>', 'Great capture.  The purple sets the mood so the colouring is well done.', '2008-08-27 00:15:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913381, 712267, 96881, '<td valign="top">I usually are not a fan of this type of thing, but this is so well executed that it works, and stands out from the group.  Well captured and processed.</td>', 'I usually are not a fan of this type of thing, but this is so well executed that it works, and stands out from the group.  Well captured and processed.', '2008-08-27 00:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4913382, 712088, 94265, '<td valign="top">Not sure that dark green works all that well with the purple but it''s a nice clear shot.</td>', 'Not sure that dark green works all that well with the purple but it''s a nice clear shot.', '2008-08-27 00:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
