(4914646, 712213, 61961, '<td valign="top">The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better.</td>', 'The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better.', '2008-08-27 10:36:35.000000', NULL, 0),
