(4914717, 711540, 29011, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. I like the subtle purple. From looking at your score, which is really good still, some people wanted a stronger purple but I''m glad people appreciated it overall.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. I like the subtle purple. From looking at your score, which is really good still, some people wanted a stronger purple but I''m glad people appreciated it overall.', '2008-08-27 11:04:58.000000', NULL, 0),
