(4914734, 710673, 6667, '<td valign="top">Congrats, MaryO, on a nice finish.  Glory, glory glory!</td>', 'Congrats, MaryO, on a nice finish.  Glory, glory glory!', '2008-08-27 11:13:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914735, 712079, 3724, '<td valign="top">Even though contrived &amp; staged, a small detail such as bloodshot eyes may contributed to more realism. I think the colour and texture of the dried blood is pretty good. A good creative idea with a strong message regarding the brutal aftermath of violence in this entry.</td>', 'Even though contrived & staged, a small detail such as bloodshot eyes may contributed to more realism. I think the colour and texture of the dried blood is pretty good. A good creative idea with a strong message regarding the brutal aftermath of violence in this entry.', '2008-08-27 11:14:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914740, 711959, 87808, '<td valign="top">I actually really like this shot. It is hard to capture purples.  I think that the things for me that stand out and lowered your score are the focus issue, the wine glass is not looking straight and seems to tilt to one side.  the mirror just doesnt work.  If you had got in closer with a tighter look at it, then i think this would have scored higher.  try it again  with some of the suggestions listed in the comments.</td>', 'I actually really like this shot. It is hard to capture purples.  I think that the things for me that stand out and lowered your score are the focus issue, the wine glass is not looking straight and seems to tilt to one side.  the mirror just doesnt work.  If you had got in closer with a tighter look at it, then i think this would have scored higher.  try it again  with some of the suggestions listed in the comments.', '2008-08-27 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914741, 710807, 3724, '<td valign="top">Enjoy this purple and green creative edit. 7</td>', 'Enjoy this purple and green creative edit. 7', '2008-08-27 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914745, 712324, 87808, '<td valign="top">dang shoudl have had that contest with you on this shot. =P</td>', 'dang shoudl have had that contest with you on this shot. =P', '2008-08-27 11:21:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914748, 712234, 29011, '<td valign="top">I can appreciate the prep time going in and think you did a great job with the details. I don''t mind the use of my name in the title one bit. I''m actually honored you gave the shot a go. I like the lighting, it''s just different. In some ways I like it more than in my shot. I find this fun in spoof kind of way, eggplant for grapejuice LOL. Still it''s all purple and good looking.</td>', 'I can appreciate the prep time going in and think you did a great job with the details. I don''t mind the use of my name in the title one bit. I''m actually honored you gave the shot a go. I like the lighting, it''s just different. In some ways I like it more than in my shot. I find this fun in spoof kind of way, eggplant for grapejuice LOL. Still it''s all purple and good looking.', '2008-08-27 11:23:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914757, 712341, 3724, '<td valign="top">Presentation feels a little awkward, a simple square crop may have been just as effective.<br/>I like the subject w/moth. Dof &amp; seemingly creative colour edit also contribute very nicely. 7.</td>', 'Presentation feels a little awkward, a simple square crop may have been just as effective.I like the subject w/moth. Dof & seemingly creative colour edit also contribute very nicely. 7.', '2008-08-27 11:27:12.000000', NULL, 0),
