(4914803, 711040, 3724, '<td valign="top">Very good subject -</td>', 'Very good subject -', '2008-08-27 11:43:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914810, 711337, 29011, '<td valign="top">I agree with the comments, the angle and composition works great here. I like the little touches of wardrobe with the hat and blazer which connects the model and car. The light on the car and model looks great. Can''t think of a specific reason as to why people would vote this low, because I see a bunch of purple skies made the top20 ;) The only slightest nitpick for me was the little patch of bright sky, but being this is basic thinking voters would be lenient with that. It''s a very good addition to your portfolio and if you''re to re-edit I''d just patch that bit of sky.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-27 10:47:45.</i></td>', 'I agree with the comments, the angle and composition works great here. I like the little touches of wardrobe with the hat and blazer which connects the model and car. The light on the car and model looks great. Can''t think of a specific reason as to why people would vote this low, because I see a bunch of purple skies made the top20 ;) The only slightest nitpick for me was the little patch of bright sky, but being this is basic thinking voters would be lenient with that. It''s a very good addition to your portfolio and if you''re to re-edit I''d just patch that bit of sky.', '2008-08-27 11:46:05.000000', '2008-08-27 11:47:45.000000', 0),
(4914819, 710673, 3724, '<td valign="top">none more deserving - congratulations.</td>', 'none more deserving - congratulations.', '2008-08-27 11:48:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4914835, 712302, 37684, '<td valign="top">Yeah, Chelle, my first twinge was the break in the background too.  Other than that, I think you had a great idea.<br/> <br/>I can see where the one flower floating is very much the best part of the picture, and maybe turned the other direction with the teapot behind the cup, and oof....  <br/> <br/>ah well you still scored well... and I''m proud of you!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Yeah, Chelle, my first twinge was the break in the background too.  Other than that, I think you had a great idea. I can see where the one flower floating is very much the best part of the picture, and maybe turned the other direction with the teapot behind the cup, and oof....   ah well you still scored well... and I''m proud of you! ', '2008-08-27 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 0),
