(4915368, 711552, 29011, '<td valign="top">This has enough purple in it. Challenge theme aside...<br/>Brilliant capture of bees at work. Needs just a slight boost in contrast and print out and be proud of. You should be :)<br/>The point of focus and control of DOF, this shows great skill. I''ve seen tons of insect shots and macros a like. This has something special about it. Goes beyond the technicals, which this has a lot good of and steps into the art realm.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-27 13:05:32.</i></td>', 'This has enough purple in it. Challenge theme aside...Brilliant capture of bees at work. Needs just a slight boost in contrast and print out and be proud of. You should be :)The point of focus and control of DOF, this shows great skill. I''ve seen tons of insect shots and macros a like. This has something special about it. Goes beyond the technicals, which this has a lot good of and steps into the art realm.', '2008-08-27 14:02:10.000000', '2008-08-27 14:05:32.000000', 0),
