(4915613, 711781, 40687, '<td valign="top">This was my first submission so I''m relieved not to have come last.<br/> <br/>The title came from my 2 1/2 year old son who was very impressed with the shot.<br/> <br/>I struggled a bit to get the focus, I think the lights emit some infra red which confused the camera (the splodges of bright colour weren''t visible to the eye), but I was pleased with the rich purple in between which was the effect I was looking for.</td>', 'This was my first submission so I''m relieved not to have come last. The title came from my 2 1/2 year old son who was very impressed with the shot. I struggled a bit to get the focus, I think the lights emit some infra red which confused the camera (the splodges of bright colour weren''t visible to the eye), but I was pleased with the rich purple in between which was the effect I was looking for.', '2008-08-27 15:49:03.000000', NULL, 0),
