(4915908, 712302, 88942, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by chesire:</b></div><hr/><i> Yeah, Chelle, my first twinge was the break in the background too.  Other than that, I think you had a great idea.<br/> <br/>I can see where the one flower floating is very much the best part of the picture, and maybe turned the other direction with the teapot behind the cup, and oof....  <br/> <br/>ah well you still scored well... and I''m proud of you! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks!  :-)  Yeah, Perhaps I should quit taking pictures an hour before the challenge ends?  I''m a horrible procrastinator.  When I grow up, I wanna be totally together and get things done early!  I should get there somewhere in the next forty years.  lol</td>', 'Originally posted by chesire: Yeah, Chelle, my first twinge was the break in the background too.  Other than that, I think you had a great idea. I can see where the one flower floating is very much the best part of the picture, and maybe turned the other direction with the teapot behind the cup, and oof....   ah well you still scored well... and I''m proud of you!   Thanks!  :-)  Yeah, Perhaps I should quit taking pictures an hour before the challenge ends?  I''m a horrible procrastinator.  When I grow up, I wanna be totally together and get things done early!  I should get there somewhere in the next forty years.  lol', '2008-08-27 17:47:27.000000', NULL, 0),
