(4916232, 710595, 66515, '<td valign="top">I personally like the idea but I''d have to say that its quite hard to execute. Yeah the focus is a little off but even if that was corrected it might be a tough sell. Moving the wrapper to a more prominent location in the scene would help I think as would removing the red items as suggested previously. <br/> <br/>Different isn''t a bad idea but don''t be surprised if you get dinged for it. Also don''t be surprised when people marvel at your ingenuity. :)</td>', 'I personally like the idea but I''d have to say that its quite hard to execute. Yeah the focus is a little off but even if that was corrected it might be a tough sell. Moving the wrapper to a more prominent location in the scene would help I think as would removing the red items as suggested previously.  Different isn''t a bad idea but don''t be surprised if you get dinged for it. Also don''t be surprised when people marvel at your ingenuity. :)', '2008-08-27 19:50:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916246, 712108, 66515, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by LadyTara:</b></div><hr/><i> I give this 5, would''ve been 6 I think if she were centered. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I disagree. I don''t think a centered composition would have worked with this. Perhaps cropping a bit off the left side maybe but not centered. Just my 2 cents though.<br/> <br/>I would maybe try a vertical orientation as well. It would maybe give more of a feeling of upward movement. It would also make the subject and her balloons more prominent in the scene.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-27 18:56:02.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by LadyTara: I give this 5, would''ve been 6 I think if she were centered.   I disagree. I don''t think a centered composition would have worked with this. Perhaps cropping a bit off the left side maybe but not centered. Just my 2 cents though. I would maybe try a vertical orientation as well. It would maybe give more of a feeling of upward movement. It would also make the subject and her balloons more prominent in the scene.', '2008-08-27 19:55:35.000000', '2008-08-27 19:56:02.000000', 0),
