(4916450, 711366, 90829, '<td valign="top">I was one of the 50 percentile that rated this a 5.. definately met the challenge! The light seems just a little harsh, but the hair and lipstick are great! Good job! :)</td>', 'I was one of the 50 percentile that rated this a 5.. definately met the challenge! The light seems just a little harsh, but the hair and lipstick are great! Good job! :)', '2008-08-27 21:09:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916502, 711366, 39144, '<td valign="top">Overall I would say that the lighting in this photos is extremely harsh. It is very apparent that the flash was "on camera". I say that because of the harsh shadow below the chin, the catchlight in the eyes, and the lack of contrast throughout the rest of the face. I didn''t vote on this particular photo, but I will say that I generally will not go much higher than a 6 if you can tell that. I was going to say that the focus was a bit off, but after reading about the neat image filter in your notes, I would say to do a little practice with that, because it is extremely overdone. Aside from that, the composition is also very plain. If I would have voted on this photo myself, I would have given it a 4. Hope this helps to udnerstand.</td>', 'Overall I would say that the lighting in this photos is extremely harsh. It is very apparent that the flash was "on camera". I say that because of the harsh shadow below the chin, the catchlight in the eyes, and the lack of contrast throughout the rest of the face. I didn''t vote on this particular photo, but I will say that I generally will not go much higher than a 6 if you can tell that. I was going to say that the focus was a bit off, but after reading about the neat image filter in your notes, I would say to do a little practice with that, because it is extremely overdone. Aside from that, the composition is also very plain. If I would have voted on this photo myself, I would have given it a 4. Hope this helps to udnerstand.', '2008-08-27 21:38:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916517, 710459, 86447, '<td valign="top">Thank you, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=77196" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">dtremain</a>!  That''s exactly what I wanted to hear-- the unvarnished truth.   <br/> <br/>I do realize that complaining about a 5.9 is not cool.  *sigh*   I did have higher hopes for this one, though, considering that a trash ''vase'' of flowers of mine did over a 6.0 :  <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=692574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/881/120/692574.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/881/120/692574.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/881/120/692574.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>It''s a comparison thing, I realize.   And really... it''s the FROG that''s more miffed than I am:<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=714843" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/86447/120/714843.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/86447/120/714843.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/85000-89999/86447/120/714843.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I hate it for him.  I really do.  :)<br/> <br/>BTW, I think you have me confused with someone else.  My hubby doesn''t do photography.   My "Too" in Lydia Too is just because there was already a "Lydia" here before me.  It''s not my last name.<br/> <br/>Thanks BUNCHES for your critique.<br/></td>', 'Thank you,  dtremain!  That''s exactly what I wanted to hear-- the unvarnished truth.    I do realize that complaining about a 5.9 is not cool.  *sigh*   I did have higher hopes for this one, though, considering that a trash ''vase'' of flowers of mine did over a 6.0 :    It''s a comparison thing, I realize.   And really... it''s the FROG that''s more miffed than I am:   I hate it for him.  I really do.  :) BTW, I think you have me confused with someone else.  My hubby doesn''t do photography.   My "Too" in Lydia Too is just because there was already a "Lydia" here before me.  It''s not my last name. Thanks BUNCHES for your critique.', '2008-08-27 21:46:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(4916557, 712028, 97166, '<td valign="top">I''m suprised this hasn''t made <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=41337" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">yanko</a> froth at the mouth yet.  He was DQ''d for a very similar (if not practically identical) border.  Which is why it was familiar to me. I thought this might have been from him, seeing if he''d get DQ''d again.</td>', 'I''m suprised this hasn''t made  yanko froth at the mouth yet.  He was DQ''d for a very similar (if not practically identical) border.  Which is why it was familiar to me. I thought this might have been from him, seeing if he''d get DQ''d again.', '2008-08-27 21:59:23.000000', NULL, 0),
