(4916942, 710459, 67697, '<td valign="top">I gave it a 7.  I am amazed at how you got the frog to stay like that.  It''s such a cute photo.  I think the only reason why I did not give it a higher score is because it was about a frog, with some purple around it.  Now if the frog was purple... hmmm.. lol  But I think it should have finished higher.  For a true example tho of one that REALLY should have gotten a better score, see mine hehe.<br/> <br/>Again, I just can''t get over how well you have trained your frogs.  I''m totally captivated by it all  :)</td>', 'I gave it a 7.  I am amazed at how you got the frog to stay like that.  It''s such a cute photo.  I think the only reason why I did not give it a higher score is because it was about a frog, with some purple around it.  Now if the frog was purple... hmmm.. lol  But I think it should have finished higher.  For a true example tho of one that REALLY should have gotten a better score, see mine hehe. Again, I just can''t get over how well you have trained your frogs.  I''m totally captivated by it all  :)', '2008-08-28 00:31:23.000000', NULL, 0),
