(4917095, 712213, 48560, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>actually, this is what i meant as well with my previous (sarcastic) comment. i think this fits the challenge. i think the real "shoe horns" are the entries that are adjusted in their hues/colours to make the image purple.</td>', 'Originally posted by citymars: The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better.  actually, this is what i meant as well with my previous (sarcastic) comment. i think this fits the challenge. i think the real "shoe horns" are the entries that are adjusted in their hues/colours to make the image purple.', '2008-08-28 01:39:59.000000', NULL, 0),
