(4917107, 712212, 82707, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image Jamie!  Well done on the top ten finish!</td>', 'Beautiful image Jamie!  Well done on the top ten finish!', '2008-08-28 01:43:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917129, 712213, 28742, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by crayon:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>actually, this is what i meant as well with my previous (sarcastic) comment. i think this fits the challenge. i think the real "shoe horns" are the entries that are adjusted in their hues/colours to make the image purple. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>ROFL! It''s RED paint. :P<br/> <br/>...just kidding, but I realized it could have been after went to the store and bought the purple. :)</td>', 'Originally posted by crayon: Originally posted by citymars: The funny thing is, I don''t think the entry was shoehorned at all (stating the obvious, I guess).  Really funny.  I love Woody''s hands in the defensive position.  The blurred hand makes sense.  The "purple" meets the challenge theme strongly.  One of my favorites, I''m surprised it didn''t do better.  actually, this is what i meant as well with my previous (sarcastic) comment. i think this fits the challenge. i think the real "shoe horns" are the entries that are adjusted in their hues/colours to make the image purple.  ROFL! It''s RED paint. :P ...just kidding, but I realized it could have been after went to the store and bought the purple. :)', '2008-08-28 01:50:30.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917194, 710459, 47791, '<td valign="top">I didnt get to vote on this in the challenge but I actually like it. <br/>Its centered which some people do not like but I do. <br/>the purple is nice and strong and the chequered background is out of focus so gives a good DOF.<br/> <br/>This photo is however let down by the frog. <br/>There are a lot of frogs out there who would love the modelling work yet this one just sits there with a bored laissez faire expression. <br/>So, either the frog is a complete Diva or stoned from the glue used to glue the crown to its head. <br/>Either way I would have given this photo 7/10 marks. <br/>:)</td>', 'I didnt get to vote on this in the challenge but I actually like it. Its centered which some people do not like but I do. the purple is nice and strong and the chequered background is out of focus so gives a good DOF. This photo is however let down by the frog. There are a lot of frogs out there who would love the modelling work yet this one just sits there with a bored laissez faire expression. So, either the frog is a complete Diva or stoned from the glue used to glue the crown to its head. Either way I would have given this photo 7/10 marks. :)', '2008-08-28 02:25:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917209, 712314, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sorry, but this gorgeous image escaped my notice when I was voting - not sure how. I would have given it a 9. It is very creative.</td>', 'Sorry, but this gorgeous image escaped my notice when I was voting - not sure how. I would have given it a 9. It is very creative.', '2008-08-28 02:34:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917229, 711250, 97225, '<td valign="top">I am surprised and disappointed that this did not do better. I gave it a 10, but this is the first challenge that I have voted in, so maybe I haven''t learnt to be picky yet. All the same I only scored one other photo a 10 ( 2nd place getter.)</td>', 'I am surprised and disappointed that this did not do better. I gave it a 10, but this is the first challenge that I have voted in, so maybe I haven''t learnt to be picky yet. All the same I only scored one other photo a 10 ( 2nd place getter.)', '2008-08-28 02:59:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917424, 710763, 37430, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on high score! Its a very neat picture.</td>', 'Congratulations on high score! Its a very neat picture.', '2008-08-28 08:02:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917501, 710459, 42198, '<td valign="top">This is quite surreal. Some DPCers would just have shot the checkered purple background on its on as their entry.<br/> <br/>But you added a pool ball... And then a frog... And as if that wasn''t enough you topped it off with a crown! Did you run out of ideas for what to balance on top of the crown? :)<br/> <br/>P.S. I think some people confused you with <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=53147" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">timfythetoo</a> as his wife is also on DPC.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-28 09:01:05.</i></td>', 'This is quite surreal. Some DPCers would just have shot the checkered purple background on its on as their entry. But you added a pool ball... And then a frog... And as if that wasn''t enough you topped it off with a crown! Did you run out of ideas for what to balance on top of the crown? :) P.S. I think some people confused you with  timfythetoo as his wife is also on DPC.', '2008-08-28 09:58:16.000000', '2008-08-28 10:01:05.000000', 0),
(4917572, 710459, 34059, '<td valign="top">I did not vote in the challenge but I think I would have thought the following.<br/>The important things are ok (focus, color, details) so you get minimum 5. An extra point for the wonderful frog and overall creativity: 6.<br/>Then... nothing else! For me the most distracting and ugly thing of this picture is the purple in it, it''s a horrible background for your subject. Had it been yellow or blue (or even green) I would have liked the photo so much more! <br/>But if the biggest thing that does not work in a picture is the only reason why that picture was submitted in a particular challenge, well, I would not vote any higher than 6.<br/>Please keep on shooting frogs, you do wonderful pictures!<br/>especially this one...<a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=702557" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/702557.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/702557.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/0-999/886/120/702557.jpg"/></a></td>', 'I did not vote in the challenge but I think I would have thought the following.The important things are ok (focus, color, details) so you get minimum 5. An extra point for the wonderful frog and overall creativity: 6.Then... nothing else! For me the most distracting and ugly thing of this picture is the purple in it, it''s a horrible background for your subject. Had it been yellow or blue (or even green) I would have liked the photo so much more! But if the biggest thing that does not work in a picture is the only reason why that picture was submitted in a particular challenge, well, I would not vote any higher than 6.Please keep on shooting frogs, you do wonderful pictures!especially this one...', '2008-08-28 10:39:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917585, 712294, 91496, '<td valign="top">The photo for me is mixed.  I like the concept, but do not feel any part of it jumps out at me.  While the result is colorful, none of the bands of colors stands out to draw your eye.  The colors all seem a little random, perhaps some more symeetry would have helped.  The highlights on the glass and bottem of the orange part detract a bit.  I agree with the prior comment about changing to a horizontal crop would have made a huge difference.  BTW finishing in the top half of any DPC challenge is always a good thing!</td>', 'The photo for me is mixed.  I like the concept, but do not feel any part of it jumps out at me.  While the result is colorful, none of the bands of colors stands out to draw your eye.  The colors all seem a little random, perhaps some more symeetry would have helped.  The highlights on the glass and bottem of the orange part detract a bit.  I agree with the prior comment about changing to a horizontal crop would have made a huge difference.  BTW finishing in the top half of any DPC challenge is always a good thing!', '2008-08-28 10:44:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917610, 712028, 58728, '<td valign="top">Just wanted to stop by and tell you how creative and lovely this shot is and the border gives it even extra beauty.  Love it.</td>', 'Just wanted to stop by and tell you how creative and lovely this shot is and the border gives it even extra beauty.  Love it.', '2008-08-28 10:58:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917623, 712028, 90495, '<td valign="top">This border makes this pic about a border, not about a flower. That''s all I seem to look at. Way too imposing.</td>', 'This border makes this pic about a border, not about a flower. That''s all I seem to look at. Way too imposing.', '2008-08-28 11:06:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(4917825, 712179, 73564, '<td valign="top">I really liked this picture, I thought I could get by with the purple background being in focus, well I was wrong, but I still like it.</td>', 'I really liked this picture, I thought I could get by with the purple background being in focus, well I was wrong, but I still like it.', '2008-08-28 13:17:50.000000', NULL, 0),
