(4919713, 712279, 90495, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering why you didn''t buy makeup like <a href="//www.snazaroo.com/world/product_index.php/cPath/21_28" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Snazaroo</a>, this is great stuff that goes on well and comes off with warm water and some soap for the reds. I use a paintbrush and some water to dilute it and paint it on my face. It dries quickly and you can paint over it for making nice straight lines.<br/> <br/>This was my second attempt with the make up, i''m new to makeup application. ;)<br/> <br/>[thumb]710999[/thumb]<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-29 12:43:25.</i></td>', 'I''m wondering why you didn''t buy makeup like Snazaroo, this is great stuff that goes on well and comes off with warm water and some soap for the reds. I use a paintbrush and some water to dilute it and paint it on my face. It dries quickly and you can paint over it for making nice straight lines. This was my second attempt with the make up, i''m new to makeup application. ;) [thumb]710999[/thumb]', '2008-08-29 13:39:54.000000', '2008-08-29 13:43:25.000000', 0),
