(4920926, 711950, 20330, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Jac:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by salmiakki:</b></div><hr/><i> Cannot for the life of me figure out how this scored less than a 6.  One of my favourites in this challenge. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Me too. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>THANKS GUYS :)</td>', 'Originally posted by Jac: Originally posted by salmiakki: Cannot for the life of me figure out how this scored less than a 6.  One of my favourites in this challenge.   Me too.   THANKS GUYS :)', '2008-08-30 03:38:10.000000', NULL, 0),
