(4921307, 711781, 66384, '<td valign="top">Nice idea and well done. I like the color mix in the background.<br/> <br/>P.S. Welcome to DPC. Judging by this first entry, you are going to do well here.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-08-30 10:37:39.</i></td>', 'Nice idea and well done. I like the color mix in the background. P.S. Welcome to DPC. Judging by this first entry, you are going to do well here.', '2008-08-30 11:33:49.000000', '2008-08-30 11:37:39.000000', 0),
(4921424, 711366, 3936, '<td valign="top">I think your image scored a lot lower than it should have.  At first glance the skin tones are washed out.  However post challenge I have the advantage of seeing your intent.  <br/> <br/>Focus and depth if field are both very good.<br/> <br/>I think that the crop may be a tiny bit tight.  I''d like to see a little more hair on top of the head.<br/> <br/>I really like the intent stare directly into the camera, and the expression of the model is fantastic.  That tiny half smile, that sort of says I know something you don''t, is great.<br/> <br/>Although everything is very centered, I''m not sure there was a better way to do it.  But you probably lost a few votes with the people who had the rule of thirds checklist in their hands.<br/> <br/>Nice work...</td>', 'I think your image scored a lot lower than it should have.  At first glance the skin tones are washed out.  However post challenge I have the advantage of seeing your intent.   Focus and depth if field are both very good. I think that the crop may be a tiny bit tight.  I''d like to see a little more hair on top of the head. I really like the intent stare directly into the camera, and the expression of the model is fantastic.  That tiny half smile, that sort of says I know something you don''t, is great. Although everything is very centered, I''m not sure there was a better way to do it.  But you probably lost a few votes with the people who had the rule of thirds checklist in their hands. Nice work...', '2008-08-30 13:00:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(4921690, 710673, 80096, '<td valign="top">I love your florals, they''re borderline abstract and very lovely. I''m going to have to try capturing some florals like this and see how they turn out.</td>', 'I love your florals, they''re borderline abstract and very lovely. I''m going to have to try capturing some florals like this and see how they turn out.', '2008-08-30 15:27:22.000000', NULL, 0),
