(5005689, 711554, 67697, '<td valign="top">I was looking for someone to give my 6500th comment too and I landed here :D<br/> <br/>I gave this a 7 during the challenge.  I loved the concept and the use of the extra piece of material to symbolize the blowing wind.  I think I did not give it higher because the purple on her face did not seem quite right.  I love your symbolic sense of freedom shown here.  Who doesn''t like to stand there and feel the wind blowing like that?  Very cool.</td>', 'I was looking for someone to give my 6500th comment too and I landed here :D I gave this a 7 during the challenge.  I loved the concept and the use of the extra piece of material to symbolize the blowing wind.  I think I did not give it higher because the purple on her face did not seem quite right.  I love your symbolic sense of freedom shown here.  Who doesn''t like to stand there and feel the wind blowing like that?  Very cool.', '2008-10-12 22:22:47.000000', NULL, 0),
